Subject: with_context block returns its value

with_context returns what its block returns (CurlDownloadStrategy#expand_deferred_environment_args maps its args in
one), so the block is typed as returning a value, as the method already is.
---
diff --git a/Library/Homebrew/context.rb b/Library/Homebrew/context.rb
index 3dc60ac06f..8b7630837b 100644
--- a/Library/Homebrew/context.rb
+++ b/Library/Homebrew/context.rb
@@ -93,7 +93,7 @@ module Context
       quiet:                          T::Boolean,
       verbose:                        T::Boolean,
       deferred_environment_expansion: T::Boolean,
-      _block:                         T.proc.void,
+      _block:                         T.proc.returns(T.untyped),
     ).returns(T.untyped)
   }
   def with_context(debug: debug?, quiet: quiet?, verbose: verbose?,
